    AWAIT_CUE 64
    ROTATE_RELATIVE 3 1 DIR_TRANS_SPINRIGHT2
    AWAIT_CUE 64
    ROTATE_RELATIVE 3 2 DIR_TRANS_SPINLEFT1
    AWAIT_CUE 64
